{% schema %}
{
  "name": "About Page",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}

<div class="about-hero">
  {% render 'node-motif', variant: 'hero' %}
  <div class="container">
    <span class="mono-label">Our Story</span>
    <h1>About Myndspark</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 19px; color: var(--color-text-light); max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto;">
      We're not just another brain game company. We build tools for people determined to rehabilitate their cognitive abilities after brain injuries.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="container" style="padding: 80px 24px;">
  <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;">
    <blockquote style="font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-text); font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 16px;">
      "There are various groups that develop brain games and activities intending to enhance brain function, but we're not one of them. We've designed our tool with a focus on those who are determined to rehabilitate their cognitive abilities after suffering from brain injuries. The task of regaining your cognitive efficiency after a debilitating injury can be incredibly daunting. We started our journey determined to make that task easier for everyone."
    </blockquote>
    <p style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-primary);">— Katie &amp; Jacob</p>
  </div>
</div>

<section style="padding: 0 0 80px;" id="philosophy">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="mono-label">Our Philosophy</span>
      <h2>The Philosophy of Myndspark</h2>
      <p>Our therapeutic activities are grounded in the science of how the brain heals.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="steps-grid">
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-card__icon"><svg width="28" height="28"><use href="#icon-engage"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Neurovascular Coupling</h3>
        <p>Neurons and blood vessels are in constant communication. When the brain activates to perform a task, blood vessels deliver the oxygen and nutrients that region needs to function. A brain injury can dysregulate this coupling, restricting blood flow and reducing efficiency.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-card__icon"><svg width="28" height="28"><use href="#icon-multi-sensory"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Multi-Sensory Activation</h3>
        <p>Our Cognitive Efficiency Tool activates specific areas of the brain and creates strong multi-sensory connections. Combining hands-on, multisensory activities with physical exercise helps restore proper neurovascular communication and return the brain to optimal functioning.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-card__icon"><svg width="28" height="28"><use href="#icon-logic"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Rebuilding Direct Pathways</h3>
        <p>After an injury, the brain compensates by creating alternative routes &mdash; like taking backroads instead of the freeway. You still get there, but less efficiently, which can cause cognitive, physical, and emotional symptoms. Our tool helps reestablish those more direct pathways.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="max-width: 720px; margin: 56px auto 0; text-align: center;">
      <span class="mono-label" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--color-secondary);">Our Story</span>
      <p style="font-size: 17px; color: var(--color-text-light); line-height: 1.6;">
        Myndspark is a family-owned business, and the whole family takes part. Our mission is simple: help people recovering from concussions and brain injuries rebuild, strengthen, and improve their brain health &mdash; from home.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding: 0 0 80px;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="founder-grid">
      <div class="founder-card">
        <img src="{{ 'founder-katie.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Katie Robertson" class="founder-card__avatar founder-card__photo" style="width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;margin:0 auto 20px;" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex'">
        <div class="founder-card__avatar" style="display:none">K</div>
        <h3>Katie Robertson</h3>
        <div class="founder-card__role">Occupational Therapist &amp; Author</div>
        <p>Katie received her Master's degree in Occupational Therapy from the University of Utah and has been a practicing Occupational Therapist for the last 16 years. She has 11 years of experience in acute rehab, as well as neuro-rehabilitation. She has evaluated and treated patients with neurological impairments including TBI, concussion, spinal cord injury, ALS, MS, brain tumors, stroke, Dementia, Alzheimer's, Parkinson's, Anoxic brain injuries, Carbon Monoxide poisoning, and subarachnoid hemorrhage.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 12px;">Katie is most interested in learning how to best treat those with brain injuries and help them return to a more functional and independent life. Five years ago she started working for Cognitive FX, the Premier Center for Concussion Treatment, as a Neuro-Occupational Therapist. Working at Cognitive FX she helps those suffering from post-concussion syndrome, Stroke, ADHD, and anoxic brain injuries.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="founder-card">
        <div class="founder-card__avatar">J</div>
        <h3>Jacob Raymer</h3>
        <div class="founder-card__role">Business Executive &amp; Author</div>
        <p>Jacob currently leads organizational transformation efforts throughout 15 hospitals and numerous practices utilizing lean principles. He helps organizations create stronger alignment by leading the development of their organizational strategies. He is responsible for guiding Change Management, Continuous Improvement, and Leadership Development.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 12px;">Jacob has coached and trained over 100 companies and addressed thousands of people in keynotes, seminars, and workshops throughout North America and over 20 countries worldwide. He has conducted high-level consulting assignments within various industries in strategic mobilization and organizational development. Companies include General Motors, 3M, Perrigo, Boeing, MayoClinic, Trinity Healthcare, GE Energy, Goodyear Tire, and others.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-section cta-section--navy">
  {% render 'node-motif', variant: 'cta' %}
  <div class="container">
    <span class="mono-label">Start Today</span>
    <h2>Experience Myndspark Today</h2>
    <p>Boost your brain power.</p>
    <a href="/products/myndspark-cognitive-efficiency-tool" class="btn btn--on-dark btn--large">Get Your Kit — $210</a>
  </div>
</section>
